Vendored subset of facebookresearch/eb_jepa (https://github.com/facebookresearch/eb_jepa,
Apache-2.0, see LICENSE in this directory), branch hier_cost_exp @ 280505d, modified for the
PEIRA paper: kept only the import closure of train.py and probe.py (losses/anticollapse.py,
utils/{checkpoint,config,distributed,logging,optimizers,training}.py); removed PEIRALoss
(now the peira_loss package), VCLoss, the hierarchical/video/planning code and all unreachable
functions; moved build_optimizer from builders.py into utils/optimizers.py; added `_base_`
config inheritance to utils/config.py; reduced experiment naming to image pretraining.

Added for the PEIRA experiments (not in hier_cost_exp @ 280505d): utils/rank.py (effective
rank); VICRegReferenceLoss in losses/anticollapse.py; LARSReference and exclude_bias_and_norm
in utils/optimizers.py; resume helpers in utils/checkpoint.py (trainable_state_dict,
derive_resume_position, should_save_intra_epoch, is_training_complete) and
utils/training.py (exit_if_training_complete); unwrap_model in utils/distributed.py.

VICRegReferenceLoss and LARSReference port the VICReg loss and LARS optimizer of
facebookresearch/vicreg (https://github.com/facebookresearch/vicreg, main_vicreg.py),
